### Explicit JSON
POST http://api.example.com/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": 1}

### Sniffed JSON
POST http://api.example.com/sniff-json

{"a": 1}

### Sniffed XML
POST http://api.example.com/sniff-xml

<note>hello</note>

### Sniffed form
POST http://api.example.com/sniff-form

a=1&b=2

### Sniffed text
POST http://api.example.com/sniff-text

just some plain text
